#: bot.py:139
msgid ""
"👋 I approve join requests to your private channel automatically.\n"
"\n"
"To connect a channel, add me as an administrator with the <b>Add members</b> right. Only the "
"channel owner can do this."
msgstr ""
"👋 I approve join requests to your private channel automatically.\n"
"\n"
"To connect a channel, add me as an administrator with the <b>Add members</b> right. Only the "
"channel owner can do this."

#: bot.py:150
msgid "Your channels:"
msgstr "Your channels:"

#: bot.py:159
msgid ""
"<b>How to connect a channel</b>\n"
"\n"
"1. Open your channel → Administrators → Add admin\n"
"2. Pick me and leave the <b>Add members</b> right enabled\n"
"3. Come back here — the channel will show up in the list\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ Only the channel <b>owner</b> can connect it. An administrator is not enough.\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ Join requests that are already pending stay pending: Telegram gives bots no way to read them. "
"Approve those once by hand — everything after that is on me."
msgstr ""
"<b>How to connect a channel</b>\n"
"\n"
"1. Open your channel → Administrators → Add admin\n"
"2. Pick me and leave the <b>Add members</b> right enabled\n"
"3. Come back here — the channel will show up in the list\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ Only the channel <b>owner</b> can connect it. An administrator is not enough.\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ Join requests that are already pending stay pending: Telegram gives bots no way to read them. "
"Approve those once by hand — everything after that is on me."

